TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water with fixed O2, allow goethite and gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0     0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum   0    0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Alk
    10 PUNCH ALK
END
